  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Spring Boot Testing Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Spring Boot Testing Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Pick the Narrowest Test",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Unit test",
                    "sub": "no Spring",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Slice test",
                    "sub": "partial context",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "@SpringBootTest",
                    "sub": "full context",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Pick the ==narrowest== test that proves the behavior",
                "`spring-boot-starter-test` bundles JUnit 5, AssertJ, Mockito, Hamcrest, JSONassert, JsonPath, Spring Test"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Full Context and Caching",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "webEnvironment",
                "Effect"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`MOCK` (default)",
                  "no real server"
                ],
                [
                  "`RANDOM_PORT`",
                  "starts embedded server"
                ],
                [
                  "`DEFINED_PORT`",
                  "uses `server.port`"
                ],
                [
                  "`NONE`",
                  "no web layer"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Config found by searching ==upward== from the test package for `@SpringBootConfiguration`",
                "Keep tests in the **same package tree** as the main app class"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Context caching",
              "text": "Identical config ==reuses== one context. A different `@MockBean` set, properties or profiles builds a **new** one and slows the suite."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Interview Point",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Which test first?** Plain unit test; slice next, full context only if needed",
                "**Default webEnvironment?** `MOCK`, no real server",
                "**Why is the suite slow?** Many distinct contexts defeat caching",
                "**Test cannot find config?** Move it under the main class's package"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "purple"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Slice Tests and MockMvc",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Slice Tests and MockMvc",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. @WebMvcTest and MockMvc",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`@WebMvcTest(UserController.class)` loads ==only the web layer==",
                "Loaded: controllers, `@ControllerAdvice`, Filters, Converters, `WebMvcConfigurer`",
                "{red:Not loaded}: services and repositories",
                "Supply dependencies with ==@MockitoBean== (Boot 3.4+; `@MockBean` deprecated before it)",
                "Missing mock → `NoSuchBeanDefinitionException`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "perform(get)",
                    "sub": "no real HTTP",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "DispatcherServlet",
                    "sub": "controller + advice",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "andExpect",
                    "sub": "status, jsonPath",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "mockMvc.perform(get(\"/users/1\"))",
                "  .andExpect(status().isOk())",
                "  .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.name\").value(\"Ann\"));",
                "mockMvc.perform(post(\"/users\")",
                "  .contentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)",
                "  .content(json));"
              ],
              "note": "POST needs contentType, else 415"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. @DataJpaTest",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Loads ==only entities and repositories== with an in-memory DB",
                "Each test runs in a {green:rolled-back} transaction",
                "Injects `TestEntityManager`",
                "Real DB: `@AutoConfigureTestDatabase(replace = NONE)`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Other Slices and Security",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Annotation",
                "Tests"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`@JsonTest`",
                  "JSON serialization"
                ],
                [
                  "`@RestClientTest`",
                  "RestClient / RestTemplate calls"
                ],
                [
                  "`@DataJdbcTest`",
                  "Spring Data JDBC repositories"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Spring Security tests",
              "items": [
                "Add `spring-security-test`",
                "`@WithMockUser` fakes a logged-in user",
                "Add `csrf()` on state-changing requests"
              ],
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Mistakes",
              "text": "**415** = missing `contentType`. **NoSuchBeanDefinitionException** in a slice = missing ==@MockitoBean==."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Testcontainers and Integration Tests",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Testcontainers and Integration Tests",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What and Why",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Testcontainers== runs real Postgres, Kafka, Redis in **throwaway Docker containers**",
                "Tests match production; {red:Docker must be running}",
                "Pin image tags, {red:never `latest`}"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Wiring",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "@SpringBootTest",
                "@Testcontainers",
                "class OrderIT {",
                "  @Container @ServiceConnection",
                "  static PostgreSQLContainer<?> db =",
                "    new PostgreSQLContainer<>(\"postgres:16\");",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "Boot 3.1+: no manual URL"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Piece",
                "Effect"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`@ServiceConnection`",
                  "datasource auto-configured (3.1+)"
                ],
                [
                  "`static` field",
                  "one container per class"
                ],
                [
                  "non-static field",
                  "one per test"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "@DynamicPropertySource",
                "static void props(DynamicPropertyRegistry r) {",
                "  r.add(\"spring.datasource.url\", db::getJdbcUrl);",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "Pre-3.1 fallback"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Where to use it",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`@SpringBootTest(webEnvironment = RANDOM_PORT)` + `TestRestTemplate` or `WebTestClient` = end-to-end",
                "Replace H2 in `@DataJpaTest` when ==dialect==, ==JSON columns== or ==Flyway== matter"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Why not H2?** Different SQL dialect and JSON/Flyway behaviour than production",
                "**Static vs non-static?** Per class vs per test",
                "**3.1+ wiring?** `@ServiceConnection`"
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Actuator, Logging and Externalized Config",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Actuator, Logging and Externalized Config",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Actuator",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Add `spring-boot-starter-actuator`",
                "Default: only ==/actuator/health== over HTTP",
                "`management.endpoints.web.exposure.include=health,info,metrics,prometheus`",
                "`management.server.port` keeps probes off the public port"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Endpoint",
                "Use"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`/health`",
                  "liveness / readiness groups"
                ],
                [
                  "`/health/liveness`, `/health/readiness`",
                  "Kubernetes probes"
                ],
                [
                  "`/info`, `/metrics/{name}`",
                  "app info, one metric"
                ],
                [
                  "`/loggers`",
                  "POST changes log level at runtime"
                ],
                [
                  "`/threaddump`",
                  "thread stacks"
                ],
                [
                  "{red:`/env`, `/heapdump`}",
                  "{red:never expose publicly}"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Logging",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Logback== is the default, used via SLF4J",
                "`logging.level.com.acme=DEBUG`",
                "`logging.file.name=app.log`",
                "`logging.pattern.console` sets the format"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "log.debug(\"User {} loaded\", id);"
              ],
              "note": "{} placeholders, not string concatenation"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Externalized Config",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Command-line args (highest)",
                "`SPRING_APPLICATION_JSON`",
                "OS env vars",
                "`application-{profile}.yml`",
                "`application.yml`",
                "`@PropertySource`",
                "Defaults (lowest)"
              ],
              "style": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`SERVER_PORT` → `server.port`",
                "`MY_APP_DB_URL` → `my.app.db.url`",
                "`spring.profiles.active=prod`",
                "Bind with ==@ConfigurationProperties==, not scattered `@Value`",
                "`spring.config.import` loads external files"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Secrets",
              "text": "Never commit secrets to `application.yml`. Inject them through ==env vars== or a **secret store**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Packaging and Docker Images",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Packaging and Docker Images",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Fat JAR and Layers",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`./mvnw package` or `./gradlew bootJar` → ==executable fat JAR==",
                "Run it: `java -jar app.jar`",
                "==war== only for external servlet containers",
                "==Layered== by default (2.4+): dependencies, spring-boot-loader, snapshot-dependencies, application",
                "Unchanged dependency layers stay ==cached== in Docker"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "lines": [
                "java -Djarmode=tools -jar app.jar extract --layers"
              ],
              "note": "splits the JAR into layer folders"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Building the Image",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`./mvnw spring-boot:build-image` (or `bootBuildImage`): ==no Dockerfile== needed",
                "OCI image with JRE, memory calculator, non-root user",
                "Dockerfile: `ENTRYPOINT [\"java\",\"-jar\",\"app.jar\"]`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Build stage",
                    "sub": "JDK, extract layers",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Runtime stage",
                    "sub": "JRE image",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "COPY layers",
                    "sub": "deps first, app last",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Non-root",
                    "sub": "USER",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Container Tuning",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "JVM is container-aware: `-XX:MaxRAMPercentage=75`, not fixed `-Xmx`",
                "Config via ==env vars==; expose the port",
                "Graceful stop: `server.shutdown=graceful`"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Common Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Whole fat JAR as one layer: slow rebuilds",
                "Running as ==root==",
                "Full JDK in the runtime image",
                "Secrets baked into the image",
                "`latest` as base tag"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Spring Boot Testing and Production Cheat Sheet",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 5,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Spring Boot Testing and Production Cheat Sheet",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Pick the test",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Test",
                "Use for"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Plain unit test",
                  "{green:first choice}, no Spring"
                ],
                [
                  "`@WebMvcTest` + `@MockitoBean`",
                  "controllers"
                ],
                [
                  "`@DataJpaTest`",
                  "repositories"
                ],
                [
                  "`@SpringBootTest(RANDOM_PORT)` + Testcontainers",
                  "end-to-end"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`415` = missing `contentType`",
                "`NoSuchBeanDefinitionException` in a slice = ==missing mock==",
                "Each distinct `@MockBean` or property set = new cached context"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Actuator and logging",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "lines": [
                "management.endpoints.web.exposure.include=health,info,prometheus",
                "logging.level.root=INFO",
                "# change level at runtime",
                "curl -X POST localhost:8080/actuator/loggers/com.acme \\",
                " -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\",
                " -d '{\"configuredLevel\":\"DEBUG\"}'"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Config and shipping",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Command line",
                    "sub": "wins",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Env vars",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Profile file",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "application.yml",
                    "sub": "loses",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
